#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""locachy-compute: daemonless headless compute node for LOCachy.

Manages:
  - Read-only base rootfs images (tarball, directory, or OCI/Docker image tar)
  - Native Linux compute containers using OverlayFS + unshare + pivot_root +
    app-init + cgroup v2 (/sys/fs/cgroup/locachy-compute/job-<id>), with zero
    Wayland/compositor dependency and instant upperdir wipe reset
  - Optional GPU device & host NVIDIA driver library passthrough and host data
    bind-mounts (including secondary NVMe / /mnt / /data paths)
  - Optional KVM micro-VMs (qemu-system-x86_64 + qcow2 CoW overlay + 9p share)
    isolated under /sys/fs/cgroup/locachy-compute/vm-<name>
  - Authenticated mTLS HTTPS control plane (port 27184) bound strictly to
    tailscale0 and (when compute_bind_tb="1") thunderbolt-net link-local IPv6,
    trusting only once-forever paired peers in /etc/locachy/peers (scope compute)
"""
